00:01:41.040 --> 00:01:45.840
The single battery only covers one side because the gateway is rated for 200 amps.

00:01:45.840 --> 00:01:49.400
The unit stores 13.5 kilowatt hours.

00:01:49.880 --> 00:01:53.280
The owner noted it lasts about half the night under normal loads.

00:01:53.920 --> 00:01:56.280
